{
  "name": "Summoner's Guardian",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your improved connection with your Eidolon allows it to defend you more effectively. You can use your Bonus Action to command your Eidolon to take a guarding stance while it is within 5 feet of you.</p><p>The stance lasts until the start of your next turn. It ends early if your Eidolon is no longer within 5 feet of you or it is Incapacitated.</p><p>While the stance is active, all Attack Rolls that target you have Disadvantage.</p>",
